{"knowledgePointId":"g5-interval-counting","passThreshold":0.8,"questions":[{"id":"q1","type":"choice","prompt":"一条直路两端都栽树，栽了6棵，间隔有几个？","options":["5个","6个","7个","12个"],"correctAnswer":"5个","explanation":"两端都有树，间隔数=棵数−1=5。","points":10},{"id":"q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"一条直路有8个间隔，两端都栽树，需要栽____棵。","correctAnswer":"9","explanation":"棵数=间隔数+1=9。","points":10},{"id":"q3","type":"choice","prompt":"围绕圆形花坛等距离栽7棵树，间隔有几个？","options":["6个","7个","8个","14个"],"correctAnswer":"7个","explanation":"封闭一圈首尾相接，树和间隔数相等。","points":10},{"id":"q4","type":"choice","prompt":"按红、蓝、绿、黄4种颜色循环排列，第11个是什么颜色？","options":["红","蓝","绿","黄"],"correctAnswer":"绿","explanation":"11÷4余3，对应周期第3个绿色。","points":10},{"id":"q5","type":"choice","prompt":"从1数到20，写出所有5的倍数，共有几个？","options":["3个","4个","5个","20个"],"correctAnswer":"4个","explanation":"5、10、15、20共4个。","points":10},{"id":"q6","type":"true-false","prompt":"直线上两端都不放点时，点数一定比间隔数多1。","correctAnswer":"错","explanation":"两端条件不同，不能直接套用多1关系。","points":10}],"reviewSets":{"d1":{"questions":[{"id":"d1q1","type":"choice","prompt":"直线上有10个点，相邻点形成几个间隔？","options":["9个","10个","11个"],"correctAnswer":"9个","explanation":"相邻间隔数=点数−1。","points":10},{"id":"d1q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"周期长度为3，第8项是周期中的第____项。","correctAnswer":"2","explanation":"8÷3余2。","points":10}]},"d7":{"questions":[{"id":"d7q1","type":"choice","prompt":"封闭一圈有12个间隔，需要几个点？","options":["11个","12个","13个"],"correctAnswer":"12个","explanation":"封闭图形点数等于间隔数。","points":10},{"id":"d7q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"按1、2、3循环，第10项是____。","correctAnswer":"1","explanation":"10÷3余1。","points":10}]}}}
